'','Indicator sharing adds 1,378 detected local target-User occurrences across 146 campaigns, with no additional detected campaign and no earlier first campaign detection. Operational User coverage rises from 38.147222% to 41.975000%. Local User occurrences are branch-local targets, not globally unique people. The single missed organization trial is Org5 in CFV1_RA_CS_030_SEED1002_VAL, with 84 exposed Users, zero qualifying detections and right-censoring under both policies.','The saved operational stream contains 350,196 events and 2,548,188 paired scoring decisions, 222,018 local alerts versus 224,251 combined alerts, 26,464 issued indicators and 105,856 receipts. All final-ten-minute evidence is retained. These are accepted Subphase 8 aggregates, imported and reconciled without repeating campaign evaluation. Operational rows include non-targeted organizations; targeted-trial denominators do not.','This event-driven comparison is not an indicator-versus-local primary fixed-grid recall-at-FPR result. The 1% fixed-grid clean-negative FPR target does not transfer to arbitrary event-triggered or campaign decisions. No operational FPR/precision is fabricated from unattributed alerts.','',
